          <li>en_GB-semaine-medium: Normal: 0.8 | Fast: 1.1 | Super Fast: 1.4</li>
          <li>en_GB-southern_english_female-low: Normal: 0.7 | Fast: 1.0 | Super Fast: 1.3</li>
          <li>en_GB-vctk-medium: Normal: 0.4 | Fast: 0.9 | Super Fast: 1.2</li>
          <li>en_US-amy-low: Normal: 0.7 | Fast: 1.0 | Super Fast: 1.3</li>
          <li>en_US-amy-medium: Normal: 0.7 | Fast: 1.0 | Super Fast: 1.3</li>
          <li>en_US-arctic-medium: Normal: 0.6 | Fast: 0.9 | Super Fast: 1.2</li>
          <li>en_US-bryce-medium: Normal: 0.8 | Fast: 1.1 | Super Fast: 1.4</li>
