          <li>en_US-hfc_female-medium: Normal: 0.8 | Fast: 1.1 | Super Fast: 1.4</li>
          <li>en_US-hfc_male-medium: Normal: 0.9 | Fast: 1.2 | Super Fast: 1.5</li>
          <li>en_US-joe-medium: Normal: 0.9 | Fast: 1.2 | Super Fast: 1.5</li>
          <li>en_US-john-medium: Normal: 1.0 | Fast: 1.2 | Super Fast: 1.4</li>
          <li>en_US-kathleen-low: Normal: 0.8 | Fast: 1.1 | Super Fast: 1.4</li>
